Problem Statement:
Design the core Low-Level system for a Ride-Sharing service (like Uber).
Core Requirements:
Rider: Can request a ride from a source to a destination. Can see the estimated fare before booking.
Driver: Can go online/offline. Can accept or reject a ride request. Can update the ride status (In-progress, Completed).
Ride Matching: The system should match a rider with an available driver based on specific criteria (e.g., nearest driver).
Pricing: The fare should be calculated based on the distance.
The system must support dynamic pricing (Surge pricing during peak hours, Standard pricing otherwise).

Entities:

Location:
Lat
Long

Rider:
id, name

Driver:
Location, id, updateLocation(), name

Ride:
Location source, Location destination, RideStatus status, double EstimatedFare

RideStatus:
REQUESTED, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED

LocationService:
updateDriverLocation(Location driverLocation)
findNearbyDriver(Location sourceLocation)

RideService:
requestRide(Ride ride)
boolean acceptRide(Ride ride)
sendRideRequest(Driver driver, Ride ride)

PriceService:
double estimatePrice(Ride ride)

